cff-version: 1.2.0
title: pararnn-torch
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the ParaSLSTM preprint and the
  ParaRNN paper below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sereda
    given-names: Daniil
repository-code: "https://github.com/bugkira/pararnn-torch"
url: "https://github.com/bugkira/pararnn-torch"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22302587
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22302587
    description: ParaSLSTM preprint on Zenodo
abstract: >-
  PyTorch sequence module for parallel training of nonlinear RNNs
  (GRU, LSTM, sLSTM) via Newton iterations and an associative scan.
  The ParaSLSTM cell is a tropical warm-start plus channelwise 4x4
  monoid for exponentially gated sLSTM. The Newton-scan framework is
  Danieli et al., ICLR 2026.
keywords:
  - rnn
  - lstm
  - gru
  - slstm
  - xlstm
  - newton
  - parallel-scan
  - pytorch
  - triton
